WEBVTT

00:38.331 --> 00:39.826
Dad.

00:39.826 --> 00:42.663
Hey, sweetheart.

00:55.688 --> 00:58.881
It's been a while.

01:11.878 --> 01:14.858
Ui Yeong.

01:14.858 --> 01:17.501
Tae Seop.

01:17.501 --> 01:19.668
You're here too?

01:19.668 --> 01:22.915
- Come on in.
- Oh, yes.

01:26.693 --> 01:29.639
- Hello.
- Oh, yes.

01:31.199 --> 01:32.972
Well...

01:32.972 --> 01:36.648
How did you just show up without even calling?

01:36.648 --> 01:41.162
I was in Seoul for a friend's son's wedding.

01:42.266 --> 01:46.429
Been a while since I've been here.
Still feels the same.

01:46.429 --> 01:49.949
This looks really nice.

01:51.869 --> 01:54.013
Seeing how we keep crossing paths like this,

01:54.013 --> 01:59.440
you must be fated
to be part of this family for good.

01:59.440 --> 02:01.485
How do you two know each other?

02:01.485 --> 02:03.438
Oh, it's just...

02:03.438 --> 02:05.788
they ran into each other in Sokcho last time.

02:05.788 --> 02:08.698
- Sokcho?
- Yes, I had a workshop there.

02:08.698 --> 02:11.535
Seeing Tae Seop then really put me at ease.

02:11.535 --> 02:13.228
Ui Yeong's always been with her mom,

02:13.228 --> 02:17.397
so I worried she might have trouble
opening up to men.

02:17.397 --> 02:19.959
That's not true. Please don't say that.

02:19.959 --> 02:23.104
All those so-called conditions,
they don't matter.

02:23.104 --> 02:26.309
Just stay by Ui Yeong's side like you are.

02:26.309 --> 02:28.694
And you, don't keep putting your life on hold

02:28.694 --> 02:30.827
just to take care of your mom, okay?

02:30.827 --> 02:34.459
Your mom has me now.

02:34.459 --> 02:37.712
What are you talking about?

02:43.557 --> 02:46.090
I know

02:46.090 --> 02:49.841
I hurt both of you back then.

02:49.841 --> 02:51.818
That's why I'm saying this.

02:51.818 --> 02:55.954
From now on, I want to live for my family.

02:55.954 --> 02:58.425
Be there with you, send Ui Yeong off...

02:58.425 --> 03:01.043
We've still got a long life ahead.

03:01.043 --> 03:03.802
Some things in life

03:04.815 --> 03:07.612
can't be undone.

03:07.612 --> 03:09.768
No matter how long or short
that rest of your life is,

03:09.768 --> 03:13.352
I don't want a single moment of it with you.

03:13.352 --> 03:15.758
So just go.

03:15.758 --> 03:19.088
Mom, Tae Seop is here. You know?

03:19.088 --> 03:23.181
That's why he's overdoing it.
I can't just let it go.

03:23.181 --> 03:25.305
And it's better he knows now.

03:25.305 --> 03:28.842
This man and I have been over for a long time.

03:28.842 --> 03:32.052
I have no interest in pretending
we're a happy family.

03:32.052 --> 03:33.262
Mom...

03:33.262 --> 03:35.153
Get out.

03:35.153 --> 03:37.902
If you don't leave, I will.

03:37.902 --> 03:40.006
I'll go.

03:40.006 --> 03:44.146
You really haven't changed at all.

03:54.014 --> 03:57.174
Sorry, Tae Seop.

03:57.174 --> 03:59.388
We'll talk next time.

03:59.388 --> 04:01.974
No, wait...

04:08.688 --> 04:12.387
Tae Seop, I'm so sorry.

04:16.791 --> 04:19.162
I'll call you.

04:19.162 --> 04:21.928
I'm really sorry.

04:30.136 --> 04:31.547
Mom,

04:31.547 --> 04:34.124
what was that? In front of Tae Seop?

04:34.124 --> 04:37.461
If you send him off like that,
how are we supposed to face him again?

04:37.461 --> 04:41.397
Then don't. What do you want me to do?

04:42.373 --> 04:44.524
Let's talk later.

04:44.524 --> 04:46.490
You make a scene like that,

04:46.490 --> 04:48.705
and now you don't want to talk?

04:48.705 --> 04:50.356
No, it's not that...

04:50.356 --> 04:53.243
That wasn't just you meeting Tae Seop today.

04:53.243 --> 04:55.647
He was meeting you too.

04:55.647 --> 04:57.837
Aren't you embarrassed, acting like that?

04:57.837 --> 05:02.663
I was mortified.

05:02.663 --> 05:05.614
So keeping up appearances
matters that much to you?

05:05.614 --> 05:07.254
Yes, it does.

05:07.254 --> 05:10.511
Maybe it doesn't to you,
since all you care about is yourself,

05:10.511 --> 05:12.301
but Tae Seop matters to me.

05:12.301 --> 05:15.201
Of course I care how my family looks to him.

05:15.201 --> 05:17.771
If you can't even stand being around Dad
for a minute,

05:17.771 --> 05:19.938
then just get a divorce.

05:19.938 --> 05:23.255
Why drag this out all this time?

05:23.255 --> 05:24.639
What?

05:24.639 --> 05:26.205
Mom,

05:26.205 --> 05:28.782
try thinking about me for once.

05:28.782 --> 05:32.265
You're always right, only your feelings matter,

05:32.265 --> 05:35.015
and I'm supposed to live by your rules.

05:35.015 --> 05:37.775
It's just exhausting.

05:37.775 --> 05:40.972
I can't take it anymore.

05:40.972 --> 05:43.794
Then you can leave too.

05:43.794 --> 05:44.839
What?

05:44.839 --> 05:48.301
You said it yourself.
I live here for me, to be comfortable.

05:48.301 --> 05:51.972
If it's that hard, then go.

05:54.099 --> 05:55.904
Fine.

05:55.904 --> 05:58.659
I will.

06:28.634 --> 06:31.061
[Episode 11]

06:39.612 --> 06:41.147
[Song Tae Seop]

06:44.836 --> 06:46.160
Yes, Tae Seop.

06:46.160 --> 06:50.126
Ui Yeong, are you outside right now?

06:52.960 --> 06:54.078
Yeah.

06:54.078 --> 06:57.594
Tell me where you are. I'll come to you.

07:03.560 --> 07:06.600
Here, drink this.

07:06.600 --> 07:09.613
Thanks.

07:20.593 --> 07:24.071
That must've been a lot today. Right?

07:24.071 --> 07:28.726
You seem more shaken than I am.

07:31.492 --> 07:33.683
My mom...

07:33.683 --> 07:39.340
she gets really sensitive
whenever my dad comes up.

07:39.340 --> 07:43.853
It's basically off-limits in our family.

07:45.779 --> 07:50.405
And of all days, he just had to show up today.

07:52.366 --> 07:55.184
Still, today...

07:55.184 --> 07:58.936
they both went too far.

07:58.936 --> 08:02.910
Especially with you there.

08:04.035 --> 08:06.738
I'm really okay.

08:06.738 --> 08:10.641
It just wasn't our day.

08:11.393 --> 08:15.268
Try not to think about it. Get some rest.

08:51.213 --> 08:53.403
I went to a flower shop,

08:53.403 --> 08:56.289
and the meaning of these flowers is
"nobility and respect."

08:56.289 --> 08:58.580
I'll take good care of Ui Yeong,

08:58.580 --> 09:00.364
whom you raised with so much love.

09:00.364 --> 09:03.623
I hope you'll look kindly on me.

09:48.428 --> 09:50.582
Tae Seop.

09:50.582 --> 09:52.966
You're up? You looked like you couldn't sleep.

09:52.966 --> 09:55.289
Where did you go?

09:55.289 --> 09:58.215
I didn't even notice you leave.

09:58.215 --> 10:00.239
I went to check out the exhibition space.

10:00.239 --> 10:02.490
Opening's coming up,
so there's a lot to go over.

10:02.490 --> 10:04.609
Oh, for the furniture showcase?

10:04.609 --> 10:07.269
Yeah. You have to come.

10:07.269 --> 10:08.978
Of course I will.

10:08.978 --> 10:12.466
What about that chair you were designing?

10:12.466 --> 10:14.359
I've been dying to see it.

10:14.359 --> 10:17.783
You'll see it soon enough.
Come check it out in person.

10:17.783 --> 10:19.373
Okay.

10:19.373 --> 10:21.184
So... what are you doing today?

10:21.184 --> 10:25.197
Are you heading back home?

10:25.197 --> 10:26.715
No.

10:26.715 --> 10:31.063
I think I'll stay at the hotel a few more days.

10:31.751 --> 10:35.541
Then why don't you stay here for a while?

10:35.541 --> 10:37.382
Here?

10:37.382 --> 10:40.031
I don't want to impose.

10:40.031 --> 10:44.367
You wouldn't be.
I'd actually feel better if you stayed.

10:47.846 --> 10:49.182
Okay.

10:49.182 --> 10:52.439
Then I'll take you up on that.
Just for a few days.

10:52.439 --> 10:53.649
Good.

10:53.649 --> 10:56.770
You're hungry, huh?
You haven't eaten since last night.

10:56.770 --> 10:58.488
Yeah.

10:58.488 --> 11:00.158
Well, I'm starving.

11:00.158 --> 11:04.055
Let's share this together.

11:04.055 --> 11:06.462
Okay.

11:18.033 --> 11:21.175
I'll text you the door code.

11:21.175 --> 11:22.238
Okay.

11:22.238 --> 11:24.721
- See you at home after work.
- Get there safe.

11:24.721 --> 11:27.933
Yeah. Bye.

11:28.977 --> 11:30.362
Ui Yeong!

11:30.362 --> 11:33.130
Oh, hi!

11:36.749 --> 11:40.392
You two came in together?

11:40.392 --> 11:43.352
Oh, it's just...

11:52.777 --> 11:55.953
That must've been awkward.

11:55.953 --> 11:58.092
What did Mr. Song say?

11:58.092 --> 12:00.082
He said it's fine...

12:00.082 --> 12:03.885
but I don't think he sees it that way.

12:05.511 --> 12:08.556
I fought with my mom last Chuseok,

12:08.556 --> 12:11.040
and we didn't make up till Lunar New Year.

12:11.040 --> 12:13.937
Wait, it took that long?

12:13.937 --> 12:16.574
Yeah, living apart kind of does that.

12:16.574 --> 12:21.000
But honestly, it didn't hit that hard.
It happens all the time.

12:21.953 --> 12:24.937
My mom and I bicker a lot,

12:24.937 --> 12:26.950
but we've never blown up like that before.

12:26.950 --> 12:29.282
I don't even know what to do.

12:29.282 --> 12:32.098
I rushed out this morning, and nothing matches.

12:32.098 --> 12:34.892
My socks, my underwear, all over the place.

12:34.892 --> 12:37.710
You must've been really out of it.

12:37.710 --> 12:38.762
Yeah.

12:38.762 --> 12:42.813
Still, it's a relief
Mr. Song let you stay at his place.

12:42.813 --> 12:45.237
I know, I'm really grateful.

12:45.237 --> 12:49.551
He's lived alone so long,
it might be uncomfortable for him.

12:49.551 --> 12:52.014
Check the seat depth from the top view.

12:52.014 --> 12:54.214
And measure the leg length from the side view.

12:54.214 --> 12:56.619
Yes, sir.

12:56.619 --> 12:59.141
Let's see...

12:59.141 --> 13:00.778
Looks a bit unfamiliar, right?

13:00.778 --> 13:06.360
Once you load the sketch into the program,
it turns into a 3D model...

13:08.329 --> 13:11.172
Sae Byeok, let's look at this one.

13:11.172 --> 13:14.002
Help me out,
and I'll treat you after the exhibition.

13:14.002 --> 13:16.335
Sure.

13:16.335 --> 13:18.543
Jin Su, you're with me on cutting first.

13:18.543 --> 13:21.142
- Sae Byeok, give us a hand.
- Okay.

13:21.142 --> 13:24.000
- Let's get to it.
- Got it.

13:30.383 --> 13:31.827
So you carve it out here,

13:31.827 --> 13:35.605
line it up with number one,
then mark it here with chalk.

13:35.605 --> 13:37.496
Then this one goes with number two?

13:37.496 --> 13:38.699
Right. Same thing.

13:38.699 --> 13:41.430
I already marked number two,
so just follow that.

13:41.430 --> 13:44.106
Do the ones in the back too,
then hand it over to the boss.

13:44.106 --> 13:46.649
- Okay.
- Yeah.

14:06.816 --> 14:09.946
Let's call it for today.

14:09.946 --> 14:12.630
You grabbing dinner?
There's a good spot right up front.

14:12.630 --> 14:15.081
I've got something to take care of.
You guys go ahead.

14:15.081 --> 14:16.350
- Nice work today.
- Good work.

14:16.350 --> 14:18.104
Bye.

15:27.505 --> 15:29.513
Oh, you're home early.

15:29.513 --> 15:32.260
You're the one I thought would be late.

15:32.260 --> 15:34.262
What's all this?

15:34.262 --> 15:39.017
Just dinner stuff and a few extras.

15:42.003 --> 15:44.771
Here.

15:44.771 --> 15:47.191
All this is for me?

15:47.191 --> 15:50.779
Yeah. You left in a rush.

15:53.804 --> 15:56.737
Even a hair tie?

15:56.737 --> 15:59.100
Figured you might need it.

15:59.100 --> 16:00.651
Thank you.

16:00.651 --> 16:03.781
It's so pretty.

16:03.781 --> 16:07.537
Come here for a second.

16:11.627 --> 16:13.593
You can use this like this.

16:13.593 --> 16:15.274
You didn't have to go this far...

16:15.274 --> 16:18.307
Come on, I just want you to feel comfortable.

16:18.307 --> 16:21.313
I don't want you feeling awkward.

16:22.267 --> 16:24.633
Thank you.

16:28.326 --> 16:29.554
I like my eggs soft.

16:29.554 --> 16:31.240
Got it.

16:33.613 --> 16:36.717
- Careful, it's hot.
- Yeah.

16:36.717 --> 16:39.227
It's hot.

16:47.668 --> 16:50.797
That smells amazing.

16:50.797 --> 16:52.589
Looks so good.

16:57.963 --> 16:59.793
By the way,

16:59.793 --> 17:05.186
how do you always know what I need
before I even say it?

17:05.825 --> 17:09.838
Because I'm paying attention to you.

17:14.037 --> 17:18.870
Want to get some air after we eat?
Or maybe a movie?

17:18.870 --> 17:22.050
I'm good with anything.

17:24.536 --> 17:27.880
I'm usually all about what the client wants,

17:27.880 --> 17:30.165
but this time, I'm doing it my way.

17:30.165 --> 17:31.933
So yeah, it's a bit of a challenge.

17:31.933 --> 17:34.691
The leaves are beautiful these days.
Want to go camping in Hongseong?

17:34.691 --> 17:35.716
- Hongseong?
- Yeah.

17:35.716 --> 17:36.801
What about Dad?

17:36.801 --> 17:40.200
Your dad? Please. It's better if it's just us.

17:40.200 --> 17:44.160
- Have him buy us some meat.
- I don't know, these days...

17:45.734 --> 17:48.011
Should I grab some ice cream?

17:48.011 --> 17:50.560
That sounds good.

18:02.910 --> 18:04.292
[Mother]

18:06.422 --> 18:09.744
Take it. I'll keep quiet.

18:11.310 --> 18:12.634
Hello, Mother.

18:12.634 --> 18:14.371
Tae Seop, are you on your way to work?

18:14.371 --> 18:15.804
Yeah, I'm driving right now.

18:15.804 --> 18:18.441
Okay, I'll keep it quick.

18:18.441 --> 18:22.720
It's your dad and my anniversary this week.
You're coming, right?

18:24.044 --> 18:25.882
Yeah. What are you thinking of doing?

18:25.882 --> 18:29.392
I kept trying to come up with something,

18:29.392 --> 18:31.332
and now it's right around the corner.

18:31.332 --> 18:35.189
I guess we'll just get a cake
and call it a day.

18:35.189 --> 18:36.867
I'll be there.

18:36.867 --> 18:37.955
Do you need anything?

18:37.955 --> 18:40.018
No gifts, no money.

18:40.018 --> 18:42.024
Just come take some pictures for us.

18:42.024 --> 18:44.068
If I ask your dad,

18:44.068 --> 18:46.733
he zooms in so much it's all face.

18:46.733 --> 18:50.876
You can't even tell if it's our anniversary
or just a random close-up.

18:50.876 --> 18:52.251
Got it. See you soon.

18:52.251 --> 18:53.360
Alright, drive safe.

18:53.360 --> 18:55.007
Yeah.

18:59.763 --> 19:04.291
If you don't have plans yet...
What if you set them up with a hotel stay?

19:04.291 --> 19:07.308
Dinner at the restaurant and a night there,

19:07.308 --> 19:10.753
it'd be really nice and cozy.

19:10.753 --> 19:14.646
I can book it with my employee discount.

19:15.311 --> 19:17.511
A hotel stay?

19:17.511 --> 19:22.776
I just want to help out a little.

19:24.442 --> 19:26.099
Alright. I'd appreciate that.

19:26.099 --> 19:28.121
Okay.

19:29.915 --> 19:33.834
Have you heard from your mom?

19:34.873 --> 19:37.007
Nothing.

19:37.007 --> 19:39.377
I figured as much.

19:39.377 --> 19:42.693
Guess she's fine without me.

19:52.037 --> 19:54.490
Hello.

19:55.690 --> 19:57.834
- Hello.
- Hi.

19:57.834 --> 19:59.114
Hello, Director.

19:59.114 --> 20:02.046
Hey, Ji Su.

20:02.874 --> 20:04.018
Did you eat?

20:04.018 --> 20:05.618
I did.

20:05.618 --> 20:07.067
Good. Go get ready.

20:07.067 --> 20:09.745
Oh, your mom's already here,
going over the script.

20:09.745 --> 20:10.769
Sorry?

20:10.769 --> 20:13.149
She's doing a cameo today.

20:13.149 --> 20:15.938
You didn't know?

20:24.898 --> 20:26.796
That's why I made my choice.

20:26.796 --> 20:30.798
It wouldn't end unless that person was gone.

20:32.691 --> 20:36.197
Why are you here?

20:36.197 --> 20:40.560
I heard from your manager
you're not being treated that well on set.

20:40.560 --> 20:41.990
And whose fault is that?

20:41.990 --> 20:43.227
Exactly.

20:43.227 --> 20:45.869
Your connections couldn't carry you,
so I joined the project.

20:45.869 --> 20:48.067
What matters more,

20:48.067 --> 20:51.357
me being here or the shoot running smoothly?

20:51.357 --> 20:52.997
- Ma'am.
- Hi.

20:52.997 --> 20:55.304
Hello. Ji Su, you're here.

20:55.304 --> 20:58.433
It's an honor to work with you.

20:58.433 --> 20:59.962
- Thanks for the coffee.
- Yeah.

20:59.962 --> 21:01.797
- Hello.
- Oh, hi.

21:01.797 --> 21:04.008
We were shooting till dawn yesterday,

21:04.008 --> 21:06.927
but seeing you really gives us a boost.

21:06.927 --> 21:08.662
- Please get changed and get ready.
- Okay.

21:08.662 --> 21:11.222
Let's get to set.

21:21.128 --> 21:22.151
Stand by.

21:22.151 --> 21:25.029
Three, two, one. Action!

21:25.029 --> 21:26.576
Ma'am!

21:26.576 --> 21:28.393
- Ma'am!
- Calm down.

21:28.393 --> 21:30.618
- What happened?
- Cut!

21:30.618 --> 21:32.399
- Cut.
- Ji Su.

21:32.399 --> 21:34.084
- Yes?
- Focus.

21:34.084 --> 21:35.628
Let's go again.

21:35.628 --> 21:38.108
Okay.

21:39.908 --> 21:41.109
Stand by.

21:41.109 --> 21:43.731
Three, two, one...

21:43.731 --> 21:45.771
Action!

21:45.771 --> 21:47.355
Ma'am!

21:47.355 --> 21:49.399
Calm down.

21:49.399 --> 21:50.850
What happened?

21:50.850 --> 21:54.183
- Cut!
- Cut.

21:57.622 --> 21:59.999
- Ji Su.
- Yes?

21:59.999 --> 22:01.963
Are you nervous because your mom's here?

22:01.963 --> 22:05.733
This is the first scene where
your character's backstory comes out.

22:05.733 --> 22:07.657
You've got to land it.

22:07.657 --> 22:10.188
Let's go again.

22:10.188 --> 22:13.107
Okay.

22:13.107 --> 22:15.420
Shin Ji Su.

22:15.420 --> 22:18.450
Don't just pretend to look. Look into my eyes.

22:18.450 --> 22:21.154
That's how you connect.

22:21.154 --> 22:23.736
Got it?

22:26.403 --> 22:30.703
You were trying to protect the kids.

22:31.316 --> 22:34.623
That's why I made my choice.

22:34.623 --> 22:39.196
It wouldn't end unless that person was gone.

22:39.196 --> 22:40.520
I'll help you.

22:40.520 --> 22:43.964
Ten years ago, when you left the orphanage,

22:43.964 --> 22:46.581
that's where we ended.

22:46.581 --> 22:53.135
Don't carry any guilt. Just live your life.

22:53.135 --> 22:54.452
Ma'am...

22:54.452 --> 22:55.992
Sir,

22:55.992 --> 22:57.803
I won't make a statement in front of him.

22:57.803 --> 23:00.075
- Ma'am...
- Let's go.

23:00.075 --> 23:02.782
- Ma'am!
- This isn't helping.

23:02.782 --> 23:04.492
- Ma'am!
- Let's go.

23:04.492 --> 23:07.272
- Ma'am!
- Hey!

23:07.272 --> 23:08.849
- Ma'am!
- Cut!

23:08.849 --> 23:10.070
That's a wrap!

23:10.070 --> 23:12.021
That's a wrap.

23:12.021 --> 23:14.221
I love that two-shot.

23:14.221 --> 23:16.490
That was great.

23:16.490 --> 23:20.190
Ji Su, stand by for a bit.

23:35.135 --> 23:39.801
Watching you earlier,
you're better than I expected.

23:39.801 --> 23:41.979
You know waiting is part of the job, right?

23:41.979 --> 23:44.445
Even if it feels like wasted time,

23:44.445 --> 23:47.742
there's a lot to learn on set.

23:47.742 --> 23:51.186
If you want to focus on your work,
you'll need a company that can back you up.

23:51.186 --> 23:54.772
Find one, and go all in.

24:05.857 --> 24:08.567
This is for an anniversary, right?

24:08.567 --> 24:09.630
Yes.

24:09.630 --> 24:14.034
My boyfriend's mom requested it as a surprise.

24:14.034 --> 24:16.391
Don't people usually go with
"Happy Anniversary"

24:16.391 --> 24:18.327
or "I love you?"

24:18.327 --> 24:19.620
Exactly.

24:19.620 --> 24:22.631
[Till death...]
She picked that line herself.

24:22.631 --> 24:23.827
But still...

24:23.827 --> 24:26.652
after all those years together,
feeling that way...

24:26.652 --> 24:28.241
Isn't that kind of amazing?

24:28.241 --> 24:30.226
It is.

24:30.226 --> 24:35.257
Maybe I should've played it safe
and gone with black for the lettering.

24:35.257 --> 24:39.115
Do you remember your parents' anniversary?

24:39.115 --> 24:41.680
Not the exact date.

24:41.680 --> 24:44.921
It's around when peaches hit the market.

24:44.921 --> 24:47.619
So you do celebrate it, then?

24:47.619 --> 24:49.003
I don't, though.

24:49.003 --> 24:51.962
It's just not something I'm used to.

24:51.962 --> 24:53.494
Come on, it's not a big deal.

24:53.494 --> 24:57.232
Plenty of families don't celebrate it.
It's just a cultural thing.

24:57.232 --> 24:59.298
"A cultural thing."

24:59.298 --> 25:01.715
Why don't you deliver the cake yourself?

25:01.715 --> 25:05.455
Your boyfriend's parents would love that.

25:05.455 --> 25:08.854
I will. Thank you.

25:09.929 --> 25:12.907
- Thank you for the meal.
- Thank you.

25:12.907 --> 25:15.092
- Yeah.
- Help yourself.

25:15.092 --> 25:17.299
- This is good.
- So good.

25:17.299 --> 25:20.011
Hello.

25:21.598 --> 25:23.541
Happy anniversary, you two.

25:23.541 --> 25:26.071
- Thank you!
- Congratulations.

25:26.071 --> 25:27.515
Sit with us for a bit.

25:27.515 --> 25:29.769
Yeah, have some cake before you go.

25:29.769 --> 25:32.361
You look familiar, but I don't think we've met.

25:32.361 --> 25:37.541
Oh, I'm actually working,
so I'll just stay a minute.

25:42.292 --> 25:43.555
Enjoy your meal.

25:43.555 --> 25:44.946
Go ahead. This is so good.

25:44.946 --> 25:47.086
- I'm loving it.
- Really? I'm glad.

25:47.086 --> 25:49.711
One, two, three.

25:51.318 --> 25:53.162
Alright, till death...

25:53.162 --> 25:54.965
- Till death?
- Let's keep loving each other.

25:54.965 --> 25:56.741
Even past fifty?

25:56.741 --> 26:01.754
Wow, celebrating like this, what a treat.

26:02.421 --> 26:04.099
Your parents must be so proud.

26:04.099 --> 26:07.844
Tae Seop's workplace is noisy and dusty,

26:07.844 --> 26:10.048
we never get to go anywhere like this.

26:10.048 --> 26:13.233
Actually,
my parents haven't been here yet either.

26:13.233 --> 26:15.695
Really? Why not?

26:15.695 --> 26:18.447
I bet they'd love it if you invited them.

26:18.447 --> 26:20.741
Want me to take a picture?

26:20.741 --> 26:22.925
Yes, yes, let's do that.

26:22.925 --> 26:24.661
- Pictures are all you've got left in the end.
- Yeah.

26:24.661 --> 26:27.040
One, two, three.

26:27.040 --> 26:30.199
One, two, three.

26:30.199 --> 26:31.719
Good.

26:31.719 --> 26:32.942
You should join them too.

26:32.942 --> 26:34.046
- Me?
- I'll take it.

26:34.046 --> 26:36.317
- Yes, come on.
- Come here.

26:36.317 --> 26:38.300
One, two, three.

26:38.300 --> 26:39.861
Let's get the cake in too.

26:39.861 --> 26:41.011
One more.

26:41.011 --> 26:43.931
One, two, three.

26:43.931 --> 26:46.268
Perfect.

26:48.029 --> 26:50.687
It'd be even nicer
if all four of us were in one.

26:50.687 --> 26:52.995
True.

26:52.995 --> 26:54.643
Give me the camera.

26:54.643 --> 26:56.829
Let me get a couple of you two.

26:56.829 --> 26:58.529
- Good idea.
- You two...

26:58.529 --> 27:00.572
- Yeah.
- Stand closer.

27:00.572 --> 27:02.008
Closer.

27:02.008 --> 27:03.784
- Like this.
- So handsome.

27:03.784 --> 27:07.104
They're gorgeous.

27:07.104 --> 27:08.542
One more.

27:08.542 --> 27:10.048
Nice.

27:10.048 --> 27:11.872
Perfect, perfect.

27:11.872 --> 27:13.560
- Thank you.
- Here.

27:13.560 --> 27:19.633
I don't think I've ever had an
anniversary this nice. I love it.

27:19.633 --> 27:22.240
You say that every year.

27:22.240 --> 27:24.646
Do I?

27:24.646 --> 27:26.014
Well...

27:26.014 --> 27:28.284
I really mean it this time.

27:28.284 --> 27:30.769
Life just keeps getting better.

27:30.769 --> 27:32.761
It was great when it was just us two,

27:32.761 --> 27:35.190
then even better with three...

27:35.190 --> 27:39.027
and now with four,
it feels like we've got everything.

27:39.027 --> 27:42.187
So you're happy every day, right?

27:42.187 --> 27:45.063
- You've never fought?
- Oh, come on.

27:45.063 --> 27:48.487
We fight plenty.

27:48.487 --> 27:50.857
No matter how close a couple looks,

27:50.857 --> 27:53.841
sometimes it's like a maze.

27:53.841 --> 27:54.918
A maze.

27:54.918 --> 27:58.816
- Or a dark abyss.
- An abyss.

27:58.816 --> 28:03.144
There's so much
I still can't even say to Tae Seop.

28:03.144 --> 28:05.816
Oh, come on.

28:05.816 --> 28:07.861
Anyway, today...

28:07.861 --> 28:09.958
we're just full of love.

28:09.958 --> 28:11.071
That's great.

28:11.071 --> 28:12.787
What a happy day.

28:12.787 --> 28:14.187
It's all thanks to you.

28:14.187 --> 28:15.814
- Not at all.
- Thank you.

28:15.814 --> 28:17.617
Thank you.

28:17.617 --> 28:20.611
- Love you.
- Love you too.

28:20.611 --> 28:24.283
I love this. This is just perfect.

28:26.127 --> 28:29.527
A brain aneurysm test
is invasive and pretty tough.

28:29.527 --> 28:31.535
Why did you come alone, without a guardian?

28:31.535 --> 28:34.447
If someone came with me,
they'd just worry more.

28:34.447 --> 28:35.738
I'm fine.

28:35.738 --> 28:38.637
I understand you don't want to burden anyone,

28:38.637 --> 28:41.471
but you really should tell
your family about this.

28:41.471 --> 28:42.683
I will.

28:42.683 --> 28:44.432
Let me know when you're ready.

28:44.432 --> 28:46.855
Okay.

29:02.834 --> 29:05.151
Your parents...

29:05.151 --> 29:07.081
they seemed really happy today, right?

29:07.081 --> 29:08.888
Yeah.

29:08.888 --> 29:10.925
I didn't expect them to like it that much.

29:10.925 --> 29:14.098
Guess I haven't been very thoughtful.

29:14.098 --> 29:17.611
- Thank you.
- Oh, it was nothing.

29:19.112 --> 29:21.939
But... is something on your mind?

29:23.440 --> 29:26.773
Oh, I've just been thinking.

29:26.773 --> 29:29.673
About what?

29:30.560 --> 29:32.303
Ui Yeong,

29:32.303 --> 29:36.952
are you really okay staying here like this?

29:38.095 --> 29:41.954
It might not be easy for you either.

29:45.187 --> 29:49.191
I know you're waiting for
your mom to reach out, but...

29:49.191 --> 29:54.001
she might have her reasons.

29:54.001 --> 29:57.427
Things you might not know.

29:57.427 --> 29:59.198
So...

29:59.198 --> 30:04.921
what if you tried calling her first?

30:08.805 --> 30:11.545
Just think about it.

30:12.278 --> 30:14.704
Okay.

30:35.100 --> 30:36.563
You sleepy?

30:36.563 --> 30:39.323
Want me to turn off the lights?

30:41.713 --> 30:44.435
- Tae Seop.
- Yeah?

30:45.499 --> 30:49.012
I think I'll head back tomorrow.

30:50.939 --> 30:55.930
You're right. I can't stay here forever.

30:55.930 --> 31:00.210
I'll go talk to my mom.

31:00.210 --> 31:03.272
I think that's a good call.

31:03.272 --> 31:05.490
Want me to drive you home after work?

31:05.490 --> 31:06.818
You've got a lot of stuff.

31:06.818 --> 31:09.531
It's okay. You're busy with the exhibition.

31:09.531 --> 31:12.795
I can manage on my own.

31:12.795 --> 31:14.232
Alright.

31:14.232 --> 31:18.215
Then go talk things through with her.

32:43.623 --> 32:46.784
If you can't even stand being around Dad
for a minute, then just get a divorce.

32:46.784 --> 32:49.379
Why drag this out all this time?

32:49.379 --> 32:50.682
Then you can leave too.

32:50.682 --> 32:54.148
You said it yourself.
I live here for me, to be comfortable.

32:54.148 --> 32:57.137
If it's that hard, then go.

32:57.137 --> 32:59.055
Fine.

32:59.055 --> 33:01.855
I will.

33:14.964 --> 33:17.608
Wow, this turned out amazing.

33:17.608 --> 33:20.657
It's even better than the design.

33:23.617 --> 33:25.687
Why so quiet?

33:25.687 --> 33:27.401
You want to tweak something?

33:27.401 --> 33:30.921
No, not that...

33:30.921 --> 33:35.269
What would you guys do sitting here?

33:35.269 --> 33:38.906
Read, listen to music...

33:38.906 --> 33:40.830
feels like a great spot to just unwind.

33:40.830 --> 33:43.432
Yeah.

33:43.432 --> 33:47.848
Then what if I made another one just like it?

33:47.848 --> 33:50.634
- Didn't you say it was for a couple?
- Yeah.

33:50.634 --> 33:52.435
You got two girlfriends or something?

33:52.435 --> 33:54.327
No, no.

33:54.327 --> 33:58.144
It just feels a little lonely, you know?

33:58.144 --> 34:00.744
Might be better as a pair.

34:00.744 --> 34:05.629
Now that we've done one,
the second should go faster.

34:05.629 --> 34:08.748
If that's what you want...

34:08.748 --> 34:10.065
I'll grab the wood.

34:10.065 --> 34:12.710
- Alright.
- Let's go.

34:57.534 --> 34:59.937
- Hello, Tae Seop.
- Ui Yeong.

34:59.937 --> 35:01.894
I just got home from work.

35:01.894 --> 35:03.467
But...

35:03.467 --> 35:06.111
it feels kind of empty without you here.

35:06.111 --> 35:09.089
Guess I got used to having you around.

35:09.089 --> 35:10.163
Yeah?

35:10.163 --> 35:13.682
So, did things go okay with your mom?

35:13.682 --> 35:15.707
Well, not really.

35:15.707 --> 35:18.259
I think I need to try a bit more.

35:18.259 --> 35:19.796
That's okay.

35:19.796 --> 35:21.696
Give it some time, it'll work itself out.

35:21.696 --> 35:23.174
Yeah.

35:23.174 --> 35:24.572
Tae Seop,

35:24.572 --> 35:28.923
I'm pretty wiped, was just about to crash.

35:28.923 --> 35:30.634
Oh, yeah? Sorry.

35:30.634 --> 35:32.971
Get some rest. Get some rest.

35:32.971 --> 35:35.544
Okay.

35:53.706 --> 35:56.737
Get this wrapped up by the end of the week.

35:56.737 --> 35:58.241
Got it.

35:58.241 --> 35:59.751
Hey, hey.

35:59.751 --> 36:03.051
Take it easy, you'll hurt yourself.

36:03.051 --> 36:04.415
- Tae Seop.
- Yeah?

36:04.415 --> 36:08.475
Got an invite from the gallery.

36:08.475 --> 36:09.996
For the opening...

36:09.996 --> 36:12.131
[Tuning the Everyday]
you're going with Ui Yeong, huh?

36:12.131 --> 36:13.812
Of course.

36:13.812 --> 36:17.218
Alright, then I'll step aside.

36:17.218 --> 36:21.371
Guess I'll go take Sua out instead.

36:27.288 --> 36:29.998
- Great work.
- Thank you.

36:29.998 --> 36:32.175
- Mrs. Jeong A.
- Hey.

36:32.175 --> 36:33.515
- Thank you so much.
- Yeah.

36:33.515 --> 36:34.945
- I'll be in touch.
- See you again.

36:34.945 --> 36:37.340
- Sure.
- Yeah.

36:42.609 --> 36:44.500
- Ma'am.
- Yes?

36:44.500 --> 36:49.897
Your husband's here. He's been waiting.

36:49.897 --> 36:52.796
- Okay, thanks.
- Yeah.

36:57.690 --> 37:00.963
- Good work.
- Thanks.

37:09.681 --> 37:12.851
I didn't want to interrupt you at work,

37:12.851 --> 37:17.760
but you make it impossible to talk.

37:17.760 --> 37:20.347
Come with me.

37:49.991 --> 37:52.056
I've already said everything through my lawyer.

37:52.056 --> 37:55.729
If anyone's not cooperating, it's you.

38:06.141 --> 38:09.844
You have to look me in the eye.
That's how you talk.

38:09.844 --> 38:11.641
Jeong A.

38:11.641 --> 38:14.041
I mean it.

38:14.041 --> 38:17.338
What do I have to do to make you believe me?

38:17.338 --> 38:21.471
You're the only woman in my life.

38:21.471 --> 38:23.075
Think about everything we had.

38:23.075 --> 38:27.348
The trips we took, the things we shared,
the promises we made.

38:27.348 --> 38:30.038
That doesn't just disappear.

38:30.038 --> 38:33.709
You were happy.

38:33.709 --> 38:36.322
With me.

38:39.716 --> 38:42.349
Or maybe...

38:44.609 --> 38:48.709
I could take something from you too.

38:52.009 --> 38:56.075
If this divorce gets out,

38:57.393 --> 39:00.619
your image...

39:03.991 --> 39:07.064
won't exactly hold up.

39:08.436 --> 39:10.968
Nice tone.

39:10.968 --> 39:12.692
Not so nice underneath.

39:12.692 --> 39:14.969
People might gossip about me at first,

39:14.969 --> 39:18.856
but the truth always comes out.

39:18.856 --> 39:22.806
And when I get the chance,
I'll set the record straight.

39:22.806 --> 39:26.733
Don't think I'll just sit back and take it.

39:26.733 --> 39:31.686
You've got a lot to lose too.

39:33.376 --> 39:37.342
From now on, talk to my lawyer.

39:41.002 --> 39:43.260
What are you talking about?

39:43.260 --> 39:45.390
So what are you going to do?

39:45.390 --> 39:47.734
What do you want,

39:47.734 --> 39:50.890
try to take me down?

39:52.287 --> 39:55.140
Move.

39:55.140 --> 39:57.311
I'm doing everything I can.

39:57.311 --> 39:58.757
Who do you think you are...

39:58.757 --> 40:02.757
You really think a nobody like you
can take me down?

40:03.394 --> 40:05.471
- Let go.
- Answer me!

40:05.471 --> 40:07.584
Let go!

40:08.232 --> 40:11.291
That's enough.

40:12.118 --> 40:14.003
What are you doing?

40:14.003 --> 40:16.710
Breaking up a fight

40:16.710 --> 40:19.972
between you and my stepmom.

40:19.972 --> 40:21.996
Second time, same ending.

40:21.996 --> 40:25.369
At least you're consistent.

40:27.584 --> 40:30.197
You...

41:24.911 --> 41:27.955
Actress Son Jeong A checked in.

41:27.955 --> 41:30.412
She didn't reach out to you, did she?

41:30.412 --> 41:35.018
No. I'll check on her since I'm at the hotel.

41:38.634 --> 41:41.251
Ma'am, I heard you checked in.

41:41.251 --> 41:45.637
Let me know if you need anything.

41:53.526 --> 41:55.303
[Actress Son Jeong A]

41:57.683 --> 41:59.341
Hello?

41:59.341 --> 42:01.464
I could use some company.

42:01.464 --> 42:04.117
Want a drink?

42:10.914 --> 42:12.219
Hi.

42:12.219 --> 42:13.790
- Oh, you made it.
- Yeah.

42:13.790 --> 42:14.982
- Long time no see.
- Yeah.

42:14.982 --> 42:17.782
- Have a seat.
- Okay.

42:18.976 --> 42:22.202
What are you drinking?

42:22.202 --> 42:24.620
I'll have what you're having.

42:24.620 --> 42:25.986
Same for her, please.

42:25.986 --> 42:28.043
Are you staying at the hotel for a while?

42:28.043 --> 42:29.903
No, just tonight.

42:29.903 --> 42:32.747
Didn't feel great being home alone.

42:32.747 --> 42:34.845
Are you still on the clock?

42:34.845 --> 42:37.314
No, I just had a bit left to wrap up.

42:37.314 --> 42:39.907
Sorry for pulling you away when you're busy.

42:39.907 --> 42:41.354
It's okay.

42:41.354 --> 42:43.191
Actually...

42:43.191 --> 42:47.500
I've been staying at the hotel
the past few days.

42:51.415 --> 42:53.133
I'll leave this here.

42:53.133 --> 42:56.014
Oh, Shin Ji Su?

42:59.625 --> 43:03.415
How do you two know each other?

43:03.415 --> 43:05.578
We're friends.

43:05.578 --> 43:08.120
Ji Su, want a drink too?

43:08.120 --> 43:10.972
Have a seat.

43:10.972 --> 43:13.538
Okay.

43:28.232 --> 43:30.190
I think

43:30.190 --> 43:34.323
I've done just about everything
there is to do with love on screen.

43:35.792 --> 43:37.483
But you...

43:37.483 --> 43:40.708
why did you fight with your mom?

43:42.771 --> 43:44.988
In front of someone I wanted to impress,

43:44.988 --> 43:50.075
I didn't want all my family's mess
laid out like that.

43:50.075 --> 43:54.335
But my mom just put it all out there.

43:55.834 --> 43:57.064
Well...

43:57.064 --> 43:59.997
life gets embarrassing sometimes.

43:59.997 --> 44:03.267
And then you move on from it.

44:03.267 --> 44:04.631
Me?

44:04.631 --> 44:10.244
I've got a thing for bad men.
That's embarrassing too.

44:11.047 --> 44:12.652
So,

44:12.652 --> 44:15.032
did he say he doesn't like you anymore?

44:15.032 --> 44:16.722
No.

44:16.722 --> 44:18.616
Honestly...

44:18.616 --> 44:21.033
I think I was the one more shaken.

44:21.033 --> 44:23.400
I guess I didn't want to admit it.

44:23.400 --> 44:27.077
They're separated, but not divorced...

44:27.077 --> 44:29.334
so I kept telling myself he's still my dad.

44:29.334 --> 44:32.384
Even if it's messy, it's still family.

44:32.384 --> 44:35.154
That's what I kept telling myself.

44:35.154 --> 44:38.771
Something you had to face sooner or later.

44:38.771 --> 44:40.155
It must've thrown you off,

44:40.155 --> 44:44.061
but it doesn't change your life.

44:44.061 --> 44:46.506
If anything, once you face it,

44:46.506 --> 44:51.959
it just makes you think more
about what comes next.

44:54.890 --> 44:56.354
What about you?

44:56.354 --> 44:58.071
No secrets?

44:58.071 --> 45:00.894
Nothing embarrassing?

45:00.894 --> 45:02.825
No.

45:02.825 --> 45:06.209
You're no fun.

45:06.209 --> 45:10.055
Let's go. You've had enough.

45:13.267 --> 45:17.814
You two go on. The night's still young.

45:17.814 --> 45:20.664
Have another drink. I'm heading out.

45:20.664 --> 45:23.870
Okay. Get some rest.

45:26.631 --> 45:29.564
Bye.

45:46.888 --> 45:50.167
You must've felt pretty cooped up.

45:51.001 --> 45:54.580
I guess I just needed some air.

45:54.580 --> 45:58.597
The hotel room's got big windows
and a great view,

45:58.597 --> 46:01.047
but they don't open.

46:01.047 --> 46:04.767
How's acting going?

46:04.767 --> 46:07.107
It's hard.

46:07.107 --> 46:09.917
But... it's fun.

46:09.917 --> 46:12.048
Makes me want to get better.

46:12.048 --> 46:13.685
I'm getting more ambitious.

46:13.685 --> 46:16.615
Look at you. I'm proud of you.

46:16.615 --> 46:18.292
"Proud?"

46:18.292 --> 46:21.345
What am I, a kid?

46:22.599 --> 46:24.623
Does Tae Seop know

46:24.623 --> 46:27.407
you're out here like this?

46:27.407 --> 46:30.566
No. I didn't tell him.

46:30.566 --> 46:33.010
You're starting to sound like me.

46:33.010 --> 46:35.547
Remember when I turned off my phone
and went to see Mom alone?

46:35.547 --> 46:38.847
You gave me a whole lecture.

46:39.767 --> 46:41.997
You're right. I did.

46:41.997 --> 46:44.300
Now you get it, right?

46:44.300 --> 46:46.635
That's just how people are.

46:46.635 --> 46:48.725
You hate feeling lonely,

46:48.725 --> 46:52.092
but you still make choices
that leave you alone.

46:52.092 --> 46:54.229
Because it's easier.

46:54.229 --> 46:58.176
Finding a place to hide.

46:58.176 --> 47:00.608
But then someone shows up,

47:00.608 --> 47:04.821
and it makes you happy. Grateful.

47:04.821 --> 47:08.527
Makes you want to keep them close.

47:10.805 --> 47:15.288
Isn't that what Tae Seop is to you?

47:15.288 --> 47:18.429
Yeah, it is.

47:22.923 --> 47:24.695
I should get going.

47:24.695 --> 47:26.255
I've got a shoot tomorrow.

47:26.255 --> 47:29.024
Yeah, go on.

47:29.024 --> 47:31.102
Take care.

47:31.102 --> 47:35.362
With whoever you're with.

47:36.093 --> 47:38.426
You too.

47:38.426 --> 47:39.606
Bye.

47:39.606 --> 47:41.297
Bye.

48:01.542 --> 48:04.368
Let's go home.

48:15.285 --> 48:16.815
Oh, ma'am?

48:16.815 --> 48:18.241
Hello.

48:18.241 --> 48:21.006
- Oh, Tae Seop.
- Yeah.

48:21.811 --> 48:22.913
Let me help you with that.

48:22.913 --> 48:25.141
Oh, no. You'll get dirty.

48:25.141 --> 48:26.791
It'll go faster if we do it together.

48:26.791 --> 48:30.144
- This way, right?
- Yes.

48:39.592 --> 48:43.705
That must've caught you off guard last time.

48:43.705 --> 48:46.638
I'm sorry for how that turned out
after inviting you.

48:46.638 --> 48:47.977
It's okay.

48:47.977 --> 48:50.754
Still, that's between me and him,

48:50.754 --> 48:53.624
so I hope you don't see
Ui Yeong any differently.

48:53.624 --> 48:57.497
Not at all.

48:57.497 --> 48:59.181
Is Ui Yeong doing okay?

48:59.181 --> 49:00.727
Sorry?

49:02.243 --> 49:05.177
Oh, yeah. She's doing well.

49:05.177 --> 49:08.946
Thank you for being there for her right now.

49:08.946 --> 49:11.969
It's late.

49:11.969 --> 49:13.526
You should head in.

49:13.526 --> 49:15.530
Alright, I'll get going.

49:15.530 --> 49:17.292
Okay.

49:17.292 --> 49:20.191
Good night.

49:36.510 --> 49:38.843
[Tuning the Everyday]

49:44.560 --> 49:46.781
[Ui Yeong]

49:47.381 --> 49:49.259
Yeah, Ui Yeong.

49:49.259 --> 49:51.039
I need to talk to you.

49:51.039 --> 49:55.280
Can you come where I am for a bit?

50:08.833 --> 50:12.284
I've been staying at a hotel for a few days.

50:12.284 --> 50:15.274
And I still haven't made up with my mom.

50:15.274 --> 50:18.251
You could've just stayed at my place.

50:18.251 --> 50:22.208
No, I've already worried you enough.

50:22.208 --> 50:26.412
Staying longer just felt like too much.

50:27.312 --> 50:29.596
I think I pushed you too hard.

50:29.596 --> 50:31.587
You might've needed more time.

50:31.587 --> 50:34.898
No, it's just...

50:34.898 --> 50:38.795
You're such a good person,

50:38.795 --> 50:41.392
I didn't know how to say how I felt.

50:41.392 --> 50:43.989
I thought you might not get it...

50:43.989 --> 50:46.939
or see me differently.

50:46.939 --> 50:49.949
Make up with her when you're ready.

50:49.949 --> 50:51.763
At your own pace.

50:51.763 --> 50:54.288
Just don't

50:54.288 --> 50:57.066
keep me in the dark.

50:57.066 --> 51:00.326
Okay.

51:00.326 --> 51:04.581
I'm going to call her tomorrow.

51:04.581 --> 51:09.087
I don't think avoiding it is the right move.

51:09.791 --> 51:11.821
That's a good idea.

51:11.821 --> 51:14.171
Oh, right.

51:15.484 --> 51:16.515
Here.

51:16.515 --> 51:18.683
Oh, the exhibition.

51:18.683 --> 51:21.248
It opens tomorrow, right?

51:21.248 --> 51:24.593
Yeah, opening's tomorrow,
but it runs for a few days.

51:24.593 --> 51:26.870
Come by whenever you can.

51:26.870 --> 51:29.290
Thank you.

51:29.290 --> 51:30.385
[Tuning the Everyday]

51:30.385 --> 51:33.305
I'm excited.

51:35.838 --> 51:38.641
It's the monthly purchasing report.
I need it by the end of this week.

51:38.641 --> 51:40.923
Sorry?

51:57.630 --> 52:02.076
Mom, do you have a minute to talk?

52:20.781 --> 52:23.582
Hey, Ui Yeong.

52:23.582 --> 52:24.988
Mom,

52:24.988 --> 52:27.383
is now a good time to talk?

52:27.383 --> 52:30.022
I'm not that busy.

52:30.022 --> 52:34.919
I was thinking... maybe we could meet and talk.

52:34.919 --> 52:37.175
Sure, I'd like that.

52:37.175 --> 52:41.603
I've got something to tell you too.

52:41.603 --> 52:44.540
Then after work, want to come by The Hills?

52:44.540 --> 52:47.537
I've never properly invited you before.

52:47.537 --> 52:50.786
We can grab something good to eat

52:50.786 --> 52:53.117
and talk it through.

52:53.117 --> 52:55.027
- The hotel?
- Yeah.

52:55.027 --> 52:57.105
Okay, I'll come.

52:57.105 --> 52:59.888
- Great, I'll see you later.
- See you later.

52:59.888 --> 53:02.501
Okay.

53:43.088 --> 53:44.559
Mom!

53:44.559 --> 53:46.396
Mom!

53:46.396 --> 53:47.781
Mom!

53:47.781 --> 53:50.906
What's wrong? Open your eyes.

53:50.906 --> 53:53.453
Mom, please... stay with me.

53:53.453 --> 53:55.098
Someone help!

53:55.098 --> 53:57.807
Mom, open your eyes.

53:57.807 --> 53:59.234
No, Mom!

53:59.234 --> 54:01.987
Mom!

54:16.475 --> 54:18.391
- You're Park Jeong Im's family, right?
- Yes.

54:18.391 --> 54:22.837
She needs an emergency CT scan.
Please wait here for a moment.

54:57.691 --> 54:59.467
There are some really great pieces here.

54:59.467 --> 55:00.501
I know.

55:00.501 --> 55:03.841
I'm getting nervous just looking at them.

55:07.671 --> 55:10.228
Hello, Ui Yeong, I'm...

55:10.228 --> 55:12.981
Tae Seop.

55:13.706 --> 55:16.475
- What's wrong?
- My mom...

55:16.475 --> 55:21.400
I asked her to come to the hotel,

55:22.898 --> 55:24.886
and she collapsed right in front of it.

55:24.886 --> 55:26.780
We're at the hospital now.

55:26.780 --> 55:29.097
- Which hospital?
- HKUH.

55:29.097 --> 55:30.894
I'm on my way right now.

55:30.894 --> 55:32.749
Okay.

55:32.749 --> 55:34.559
You're supposed to introduce the pieces now.

55:34.559 --> 55:36.312
Something urgent came up. I have to go.

55:36.312 --> 55:38.303
Jin Su, can you handle the presentation?

55:38.303 --> 55:39.949
- Me?
- Sorry.

55:39.949 --> 55:42.087
Sir.

55:42.087 --> 55:45.170
Sir?

55:45.170 --> 55:47.885
Take a quick look at this.

55:57.274 --> 55:59.972
Ui Yeong.

55:59.972 --> 56:02.772
Tae Seop.

56:07.939 --> 56:11.655
This is all my fault.

56:11.655 --> 56:14.075
If I had just said sorry and made things right,

56:14.075 --> 56:17.045
none of this would've happened.

56:17.045 --> 56:20.998
I made it worse.

56:21.825 --> 56:24.709
This isn't your fault.

56:24.709 --> 56:27.515
She's going to be okay.

56:27.515 --> 56:30.935
Let's just wait together.

56:36.689 --> 56:39.046
She has a cerebral aneurysm?

56:39.046 --> 56:42.560
It seems she didn't tell you.

56:42.560 --> 56:45.044
Then is that what caused her to collapse today?

56:45.044 --> 56:49.401
No. Today's scans show no rupture or bleeding.

56:49.401 --> 56:50.444
Oh, okay.

56:50.444 --> 56:54.956
The fainting could be due to stress
or psychological factors.

56:54.956 --> 56:56.760
For now, she should get some rest.

56:56.760 --> 56:59.369
We'd like to keep her for a few days
and monitor her condition.

56:59.369 --> 57:00.983
- Thank you.
- Yeah.

57:00.983 --> 57:04.229
- Thank you.
- Let's go.

57:05.626 --> 57:09.836
Mom, how could you not tell me that?

57:09.836 --> 57:10.940
Are you okay?

57:10.940 --> 57:14.843
I've just been a little sleep-deprived.
Got dizzy all of a sudden.

57:14.843 --> 57:16.736
I'm fine.

57:16.736 --> 57:19.145
Seriously...

57:20.702 --> 57:22.993
Mom, you're really...

57:22.993 --> 57:25.756
Sir, I did the presentation.

57:25.756 --> 57:27.716
But don't expect too much.

57:27.716 --> 57:29.839
Thanks.

57:29.839 --> 57:31.989
Oh, right.

57:31.989 --> 57:34.766
Today was your opening, right? What about that?

57:34.766 --> 57:36.856
- I'm sorry.
- Don't worry about it.

57:36.856 --> 57:38.420
No, you should go.

57:38.420 --> 57:40.386
I'm sorry I made you come all this way.

57:40.386 --> 57:41.830
Yeah, you should go now.

57:41.830 --> 57:44.340
We're okay here.

57:44.340 --> 57:48.161
- Alright. But call me if anything happens.
- Yeah, I will.

57:48.161 --> 57:51.020
- Ma'am, I'll get going.
- Okay. Thank you.

57:51.020 --> 57:54.253
- Get some rest.
- Thank you.

57:57.122 --> 57:59.380
This isn't the time to be laughing.

57:59.380 --> 58:02.360
Beats me.

58:10.362 --> 58:14.236
I thought we'd be lying side by side
at a hotel at this hour...

58:14.236 --> 58:16.036
and instead, here we are in a hospital room.

58:16.036 --> 58:18.009
This isn't so bad, either.

58:18.009 --> 58:22.288
A hospital stay instead of a hotel stay. Right?

58:22.288 --> 58:23.952
That's not funny at all.

58:23.952 --> 58:28.948
Do you have any idea how scared I was?
My heart's still racing.

58:28.948 --> 58:31.551
Even if things were tense between us,

58:31.551 --> 58:33.918
how could you keep this from me?

58:33.918 --> 58:35.975
I was going to tell you when we met today...

58:35.975 --> 58:39.138
but I ended up scaring you instead.

58:39.138 --> 58:43.811
I guess my timing's always off.

58:50.725 --> 58:53.492
Ui Yeong.

58:53.492 --> 58:56.855
I can't tell you everything, but...

58:56.855 --> 59:02.992
living with your dad,
there were so many days I felt alone.

59:02.992 --> 59:07.407
I tried fighting it, tried talking it out,

59:07.407 --> 59:09.877
but instead of changing him,

59:09.877 --> 59:14.750
it was faster to learn
how to live with that loneliness myself.

59:14.750 --> 59:17.287
Not expecting too much,

59:17.287 --> 59:20.993
not leaning on him for everything.

59:26.133 --> 59:29.563
But I thought you still needed your dad,

59:29.563 --> 59:33.403
so I just buried my own pain.

59:33.403 --> 59:35.687
Watching you grow up well...

59:35.687 --> 59:39.253
that was enough to keep me going.

59:42.679 --> 59:44.636
I finally felt like

59:44.636 --> 59:48.176
my life had settled down a bit.

59:48.176 --> 59:53.224
But then your dad shows up out of nowhere,
acting like a father again...

59:53.224 --> 59:58.810
and everything I'd been holding in
just came rushing out.

59:58.810 --> 01:00:04.607
I'm sorry for putting you in a tough spot
and hurting you.

01:00:04.607 --> 01:00:07.347
No, it's okay.

01:00:07.347 --> 01:00:11.560
I was just angry that day.

01:00:11.560 --> 01:00:15.003
I didn't mean what I said to you.

01:00:15.003 --> 01:00:17.713
You know that, right?

01:00:17.713 --> 01:00:21.157
You're all I have.

01:00:21.157 --> 01:00:24.617
You're all I have, too.

01:00:28.575 --> 01:00:30.745
Don't get sick.

01:00:30.745 --> 01:00:33.751
Okay, okay.

01:00:34.638 --> 01:00:38.825
- When did my little girl grow up so fast?
- Come on.

01:00:43.667 --> 01:00:46.091
[HANKUK UNIVERSITY HOSPITAL]

01:00:46.091 --> 01:00:47.701
- You're being discharged today.
- Yeah.

01:00:47.701 --> 01:00:50.248
You're actually a fortunate case.

01:00:50.248 --> 01:00:52.545
It's a small aneurysm about 1.5 millimeters,

01:00:52.545 --> 01:00:55.352
and it's in a good location,
so the risk of rupture is low.

01:00:55.352 --> 01:00:59.509
Just come in once a year for follow-ups,
and you should be fine.

01:00:59.509 --> 01:01:01.114
Thank you.

01:01:01.114 --> 01:01:03.679
Is there anything she should be careful about?

01:01:03.679 --> 01:01:07.063
Avoid overworking, get enough sleep at night,

01:01:07.063 --> 01:01:08.273
and no alcohol.

01:01:08.273 --> 01:01:11.706
Most importantly,
try to keep stress levels down.

01:01:11.706 --> 01:01:14.256
And don't let the diagnosis
make you too anxious.

01:01:14.256 --> 01:01:17.606
- Thank you.
- Stress...

01:01:19.156 --> 01:01:20.887
Mom, go sit on the couch and rest.

01:01:20.887 --> 01:01:23.403
Okay.

01:01:24.550 --> 01:01:25.973
Oh, my...

01:01:25.973 --> 01:01:27.913
We're home.

01:01:27.913 --> 01:01:29.297
This feels so good.

01:01:29.297 --> 01:01:31.750
It really does.

01:01:31.750 --> 01:01:33.636
Yeah.

01:01:33.636 --> 01:01:36.190
By the way, did Tae Seop get home okay?

01:01:36.190 --> 01:01:38.703
Yeah, he did.

01:01:38.703 --> 01:01:41.227
And the exhibition... how long is it running?

01:01:41.227 --> 01:01:43.517
Oh, today's the last day.

01:01:43.517 --> 01:01:45.387
Then shouldn't you go?

01:01:45.387 --> 01:01:47.287
You're sick. Where would I go?

01:01:47.287 --> 01:01:48.771
Come on.

01:01:48.771 --> 01:01:51.797
The doctor said to come back in a year.
Why are you using me as an excuse?

01:01:51.797 --> 01:01:54.430
Still...

01:01:54.430 --> 01:01:58.501
Tae Seop seems like a good guy.

01:01:58.501 --> 01:02:03.288
- Why do you say that?
- I ran into him outside the house once.

01:02:03.288 --> 01:02:05.965
He reassured me you were doing well,

01:02:05.965 --> 01:02:08.887
helped take out the trash,

01:02:08.887 --> 01:02:11.091
and even peeled the label off the bottle
before tossing it.

01:02:11.091 --> 01:02:12.862
Very thorough.

01:02:12.862 --> 01:02:15.345
Oh, really?

01:02:15.345 --> 01:02:16.698
Go to the exhibition.

01:02:16.698 --> 01:02:21.631
Even if it's the last day,
he'll be happy you came.

01:02:21.631 --> 01:02:24.131
Maybe.

01:02:24.131 --> 01:02:26.156
Are you sure you'll be okay on your own?

01:02:26.156 --> 01:02:28.587
Why are you being all mushy all of a sudden?

01:02:28.587 --> 01:02:31.561
Go on, hurry.

01:02:44.664 --> 01:02:46.048
Sir,

01:02:46.048 --> 01:02:48.688
should we have
the furniture sent to your studio?

01:02:48.688 --> 01:02:51.938
No, I'll move it myself by car
once we wrap up today.

01:02:51.938 --> 01:02:53.443
Okay.

01:02:53.443 --> 01:02:55.860
It doesn't look like anyone else is coming.

01:02:55.860 --> 01:02:58.833
Should we just close up early?

01:02:59.995 --> 01:03:02.334
Yeah.

01:03:02.334 --> 01:03:05.266
Please wait.

01:03:13.137 --> 01:03:16.063
I want to see it.

01:03:25.586 --> 01:03:28.547
[Chair for Lovers]

01:03:30.491 --> 01:03:36.071
So that's why you needed my measurements.

01:03:38.085 --> 01:03:41.129
When I design a chair, I focus on a few things.

01:03:41.129 --> 01:03:43.302
Is it structurally sound,

01:03:43.302 --> 01:03:46.019
and is it beautiful enough?

01:03:46.019 --> 01:03:48.879
But this time...

01:03:49.592 --> 01:03:52.806
You inspired me.

01:03:52.806 --> 01:03:56.238
I thought about you a lot.

01:03:58.834 --> 01:04:00.372
I hope

01:04:00.372 --> 01:04:02.729
it brings more conversation and understanding

01:04:02.729 --> 01:04:07.104
for you and me,
and for the people you care about.

01:04:07.104 --> 01:04:11.538
That's why I made them as a pair.

01:04:11.538 --> 01:04:15.117
Then it's like a truth chair.

01:04:15.117 --> 01:04:18.488
If I sit there,

01:04:18.488 --> 01:04:23.764
I'll be completely honest with you
about everything.

01:04:23.764 --> 01:04:27.021
And you're the one who has to handle it.

01:04:27.021 --> 01:04:29.454
Deal.

01:04:29.454 --> 01:04:31.565
So...

01:04:31.565 --> 01:04:34.014
can I tell you what I think of the chair?

01:04:35.624 --> 01:04:39.764
That makes me a little nervous.

01:04:43.218 --> 01:04:46.371
I love you.

01:04:46.371 --> 01:04:48.664
What?

01:04:50.888 --> 01:04:55.428
It's not just that I like you.

01:04:55.428 --> 01:04:59.060
I love you. A lot.

01:05:03.567 --> 01:05:08.127
Looking at that chair... I could see it.

01:05:08.127 --> 01:05:10.518
The way you see me,

01:05:10.518 --> 01:05:13.304
the way you care about me,

01:05:13.304 --> 01:05:18.678
and the love that makes all of that possible.

01:05:18.678 --> 01:05:20.421
So...

01:05:20.421 --> 01:05:24.391
I wanted to give you an answer.

01:05:24.391 --> 01:05:27.571
That's the best review

01:05:27.571 --> 01:05:30.517
I've ever heard.

01:05:51.577 --> 01:05:54.243
So nice.

01:06:27.026 --> 01:06:30.289
[I'll take good care of her]

01:06:33.614 --> 01:06:36.954
[You two came in together?]

01:06:36.954 --> 01:06:39.838
[See you at home after work]

01:06:39.838 --> 01:06:43.054
[Go all in]

01:06:43.054 --> 01:06:46.460
[Till death]

01:06:54.484 --> 01:06:58.471
Was there a moment you just knew
you wanted to get married?

01:06:58.471 --> 01:07:01.715
You talk about marriage a lot too, right?

01:07:01.715 --> 01:07:05.642
Is your boyfriend not really marriage material?

01:07:05.642 --> 01:07:07.481
At least he's not some guy
living beyond his means.

01:07:07.481 --> 01:07:08.706
Mom!

01:07:08.706 --> 01:07:11.443
You're trying to surprise her with a ring,

01:07:11.443 --> 01:07:13.733
but you don't know her size?

01:07:13.733 --> 01:07:15.345
Oh, my son...

01:07:15.345 --> 01:07:18.205
If you were born again,
you wouldn't get married, right?

01:07:18.205 --> 01:07:22.235
That's why I want to do a romance
for my next project.

01:07:22.235 --> 01:07:25.828
Is this a blind date?
